commit 7292d891c141aee47d896049cdbf6ef8463a6898
Author: Olof Johansson <olof@lixom.net>
Date:   Sun Sep 27 23:45:49 2026 -0700

    libtailscale: leave fd 2 alone when os_log is mirrored to it

    filch took the process's stderr in every launch. Under Xcode and XCTest
    os_log is mirrored to stderr, so every subsystem's messages went into
    aperture.log*.txt unredacted: XCTest's accessibility server logs a text
    field's value, and a sign-in link pasted into the token sheet reached
    the disk. stderr.log already dropped that mirror; the filch file did
    not. Hand fd 2 to filch only when it carries the process's own output.

