commit 96623a5f3b183b37152a5ab8007f17cf406ca2b6
Author: Olof Johansson <olof@lixom.net>
Date:   Sun Sep 27 21:28:08 2026 -0700

    share: order sessions by last share and tell like rows apart

    Both session lists sorted on the gateway's last_activity_ts, which any
    turn anywhere moves. The Shortcut's drop-down also put whichever
    gateway the app last listed first, so the foreground re-list of one
    gateway outranked a share that went to another, and every gateway's
    last destination was badged "last time".

    The mirror now keeps a per-session sharedAt beside lastDestination,
    pruned to the listed sessions at every listing; an older mirror falls
    back to its lastDestination. ShareMirror.offers builds one list across
    fresh gateways: sessions shared to first, most recent share first, then
    the rest by activity, with a single "last time" row. The app's picker
    uses the same share order.

    Labels: host names keep their port, the drop-down names the host first
    whenever more than one gateway is offered, and a session whose title
    and folder another session on its gateway also has shows its key.

    Spec: docs/features/F3-share-into-a-session.md §4.7 and
    docs/features/F18-send-from-the-share-sheet.md §5, both revised.
    Closes: https://github.com/olofj/latchkey/issues/5

